{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 35, "model_name": "nvidia/llama-3.3-nemotron-super-49b-v1", "content": "As he opened his eyes, the familiar ceiling of his apartment seemed a bit too... pixelated. At first, John brushed it off as a side effect of the late-night gaming session he couldn't remember ending. But as he swung his legs over the side of the bed, a floating health bar appeared above his head, and his morning grogginess turned to shock. He stumbled out of bed, watching in disbelief as his character stats flashed in the corner of his vision: \"Name: John Doe, Level: 32, HP: 100/100\". The world around him, once mundane, had transformed into a video game.\n\n***\n\nPanic set in as John scrambled to understand the situation. Every action, from brushing his teeth to making coffee, earned him experience points and triggered quest notifications. His coworkers at the office were non-playable characters (NPCs) stuck on repeat, spewing the same lines over and over. Desperate for a way out, John started experimenting with the game's physics, clipping through walls and abusing glitches in hopes of finding a glitch to freedom. But with each exploit, the game adapted, patching holes and warning him of \"cheat detection\" systems. John realized he was trapped, a player without a controller, forced to play out a life that was no longer his own. The screen flickered, and a new quest popped up: \"Daily Routine - Repeat.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "As", "logprob": -0.6435213088989258}, {"token": " he", "logprob": -0.10988293588161469}, {"token": " opened", "logprob": -0.14515499770641327}, {"token": " his", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": " eyes", "logprob": -2.145764938177308e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.00010895135346800089}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.020696045830845833}, {"token": " familiar", "logprob": -0.3534735143184662}, {"token": " ceiling", "logprob": -1.5207475423812866}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.00010334911348